{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20566","headline":"胡山人归王屋因有赠 · 张籍","name":"胡山人归王屋因有赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"转转无成到白头，人间举眼尽堪愁。\n此生已是蹉跎去，每事应从卤莽休。\n虽作闲官少拘束，难逢胜景可淹留。\n君归与访移家处，若个峰头最较幽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20566.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20566","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}